@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title Use Case Diagram - EduCode Adaptive Learning Platform

actor Student as S
actor Instructor as I
actor System as Sys

rectangle "Authentication & Profile" {
    usecase (Register Account) as UC1
